# Secured and Monitored Web Infrastructure

## Overview

This infrastructure hosts www.foobar.com using three servers.

It includes:
- One HAProxy load balancer
- Two application servers
- Three firewalls
- One SSL/TLS certificate
- Three monitoring agents
- Nginx web servers
- Application servers and application files
- MySQL Primary-Replica replication

Domain: foobar.com
DNS Record: www (A record)
IP Address: 8.8.8.8

